 es to help more people with Parkinson's disease live life to the fullest\,
  and funding cutting-edge research to find better treatments and ultimatel
 y a cure.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/28th-annual-ap
 da-ri-optimism-walk-and-5k-fun-run-for-parkinson%e2%80%99s/111294/
