BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Share this event Fall Fest at The Loom Hotel
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261010
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261011
DTSTAMP:20260926T144323Z
UID:6b76e4de415be69514f19d31f5d3@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate fall at The Loom with seasonal drinks\, local vendor
 s\, festive activities\, and riverside views. Celebrate the season with us
  at Fall Fest at The Loom Hotel on Saturday\, October 10! Join us on our R
 iverview Deck for an afternoon filled with local makers\, seasonal drinks
 \, fall-inspired activities\, and plenty of reasons to enjoy an October af
 ternoon by the river. Shop\, sip\, snack\, and discover a curated lineup o
 f local businesses\, including: Koncocted Bloom Bar Experience - Grab beau
 tiful handcrafted bouquets or create your own with local Rhode Island-grow
 n farm-fresh flowers &amp\; thrifted vases. Bijoux Brie Permanent Jewelry 
 &#8211\; Find your new favorite piece with custom-fit permanent jewelry. H
 erbs and Mylk Luxury Botanical Skincare &#8211\; Shop handcrafted botanica
 l skincare and self-care favorites. Holiday by Nay &#8211\; Enjoy homemade
  baked goods by Danasia. Hammer and Stain by Crafty Girls DIY &#8211\; A m
 obile craft business. Sammallas - Vintage and Handmade Jewelry Your admiss
 ion will also include a seasonal glass of sangria from The Brook\, grazing
  boards\, and a 20% coupon to use before the end of the year (or that day!
 )\, and activities from The Loom Hotel and The Brook Kitchen + Bar\, with 
 additional food\, drinks\, and vendor products available for purchase thro
 ughout the event. Come spend a fall afternoon along the river\, support lo
 cal businesses\, and celebrate one of the best seasons in Rhode Island wit
 h us.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/share-this-event-f
 all-fest-at-the-loom-hotel/111938/
LOCATION:The Loom Hotel Tapestry Collection by Hilton - Warwick\, 400 Knig
 ht Street\, Warwick\, RI 02886
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/share-this-event-fall-fest-at-t
 he-loom-hotel/111938/
END:VEVENT
